Every derivation above ends with a tc line that writes the whole theorem (LAM*|theta| bits), or with allI
lines over a tc line that writes its matrix; so D exceeds the memorisation cost by the cost of all the other lines.

    extra cost of each theorem in T_CVI and T_LNP over T_Ind (upper bounds: Ind is derived from CVI each time):
