    T_Ind = Q1..Q7 + Ind (PA).  T_Ind+lib has the same theorems as T_Ind, since the library consists of
    T_Ind-theorems.  Q+lib is Q plus six PA-theorems, a finite subtheory of PA, hence strictly weaker (PA is
    not finitely axiomatisable).  The memorised-uses variant adds each fresh Ind(phi) as a ground axiom.
